Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.05,0:00:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.52,0:00:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Henry Winchester\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.55,0:00:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我们的祖父\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's our grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.61,0:00:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是学者 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are men of letters,correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.99,0:00:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的父亲教导我们成为猎人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our father taught us how to be hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.02,0:00:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是传人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are legacies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.93,0:00:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,是旁观这个世界的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Preceptors,beholders.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.37,0:00:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,记录一切超自然现象的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chroniclers of all that which man does not understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.42,0:00:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Larry Ganem和Albert Magus\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larry Ganem and Albert Magnus.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Albertus Magnus\N{\fnArial\fs30}Albertus Magnus.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.04,0:00:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,只是一个隐姓埋名前的化名而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}His was the alias we'd use when going incognito.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.15,0:00:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们做个交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.67,0:00:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你告诉我们怎么样追踪天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell us how to hack an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.16,0:00:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我就给你点人血\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm gonna give you some human blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.12,0:00:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,听说你最近对这个很着迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Word is you're jonesing for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.90,0:00:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,地狱骑士可不是随便能杀死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knights of hell isn't exactly the dying kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.37,0:00:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,但是还有有东西能杀死他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there are some can kill a knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.21,0:00:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,初刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.94,0:00:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为那该死的该隐之印\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bloody mark of Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.24,0:00:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,没有这个印记 初刃就毫无用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without the mark,the blade is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.65,0:00:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,印记可以转移到值得拥有它的人身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark could be transferred to someone who's worthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.40,0:00:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,但是随之而来的负担非常沉重\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have to know with the mark comes a great burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.28,0:00:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,初刃到底在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where is the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.29,0:00:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,被我扔到大洋的最深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I threw it to the bottom of the deepest ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.89,0:00:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能到海底下去找 但我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't search the bottom of the ocean,but I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我会找到初刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I will find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.02,0:00:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,然后把它交给它的新主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And bring it to its new owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.03,0:00:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,如今\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.02,0:00:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowley 接电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh Crowley,pick up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他到底去哪里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell is he.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.58,0:01:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,就好像他有社交生活一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like he's got a social life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.09,0:01:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会真的在担心吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What,are you actually worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.03,0:01:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,疗伤正忙 无法接应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too busy of fitting pain to answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.71,0:01:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 留言即可 - 他就这么一个任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Leave a message - This guy got one job.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.58,0:01:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,找到初刃然后把它拿回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find the first blade,bring it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.38,0:01:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 到底有多难 - 那可是Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How hard is that - Yeah,that's Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.14,0:01:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他可不善于团队合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is not exactly a team player.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.14,0:01:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 但是他自己也不惜一切代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,but his ass is on the line,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,一周不见人影可能吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He goes missing for a week without a peep.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.62,0:01:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想知道原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,now I wanna make sense anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.59,0:01:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,听听这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.10,0:01:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.48,0:01:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.51,0:01:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他这是喝醉了给你打电话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he drunk dial you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.23,0:01:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,非麋鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not Moose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.27,0:01:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lola.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.79,0:02:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我的国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}My king.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.13,0:02:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我的航空保鲜美食\N{\fnArial\fs30}My air pri consummation treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.85,0:02:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}On it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.27,0:02:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,血基本上放空了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pantry's almost empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.18,0:02:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要一个新的志愿者\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will need another volunteer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.24,0:02:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该把这条加在清单列表里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should add that on your to-do-list.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.54,0:02:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lola,pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.96,0:03:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我天性贪婪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do believe I'm ravenous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.30,0:04:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我是Elgo\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Elgo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.34,0:04:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,消息是给Abaddon的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My intell's for Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.61,0:04:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 狗奴才 - 她很欣赏你的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Minion - And she appreciates the works you've been doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.62,0:04:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 原来是只八哥啊 - 但是她忙于建设\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A great parrot - But she's tied up securing her places.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.33,0:04:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,自己的新王国\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the new leader of the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.60,0:04:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,她向你保证所以的相关信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}She assures you that all relavent imformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.67,0:04:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,都可以告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can be conveyed to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.94,0:04:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,update.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.96,0:04:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,地狱之王已经没有胜算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king is off his game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.25,0:04:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,除了性爱 披萨和人血 他对其他的都不感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except for sex pizza and human blood,he has no interests.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.41,0:04:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经离不开我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't function without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.34,0:04:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 干得漂亮 - 还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well played - I should mention.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.58,0:04:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Winchester兄弟不断的给他打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He keeps getting phone calls from those Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.27,0:04:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他们给他留语音\N{\fnArial\fs30}They leave voice mails for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.12,0:04:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.12,0:04:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,大部分都是骂人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mostly they are rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.55,0:04:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,有一次提到了叫做初刃的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}One mentioned something called the first blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.68,0:04:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.27,0:04:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,看紧事情进展 有情况就汇报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow how this developes and report it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.70,0:04:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.22,0:05:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.81,0:05:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,能直接向下一任地狱女王汇报\N{\fnArial\fs30}I expect to report directly to the next queen of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.70,0:05:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capisce.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.74,0:05:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, do it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.55,0:05:40.42,Note,,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.46,0:05:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Winchester兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.02,0:05:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,她是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.22,0:05:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 这能解释很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,that explains a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.91,0:06:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧听着 Snooki 我能这么叫你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,look,Snooki,can I call you Snooki.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.84,0:06:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我现在叫Nicole\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,it's Nicole now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.67,0:06:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那好吧 Nicole\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,then,Nicole.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.24,0:06:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,现在有两种解决方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,we can do this one out of two ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.28,0:06:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,简单的 你乖乖讲真话\N{\fnArial\fs30}The easy way,you talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.77,0:06:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,或者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.34,0:06:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,更简单的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The easier way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你乖乖说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.29,0:06:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我个人偏向第二种\N{\fnArial\fs30}I vote for number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.24,0:06:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是想要点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just want some basic information.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.62,0:06:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Crolwey的消息罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}On Crowley,that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.00,0:06:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,问谷歌 行了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Google it.Are we done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.02,0:06:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,别打脸 你有病啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow,not the face,are you crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.89,0:06:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 地狱里的事儿不会到处乱跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen,guys,what happens in hell stays in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.99,0:06:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.45,0:06:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,有Crowley称王的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,but don't you have a pretty sweet deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.53,0:06:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都有好差事可做\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Crowley in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.21,0:06:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,如果Abaddon上位\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Abaddon wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.63,0:06:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,情况可就不会这么好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can kiss all that goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.98,0:06:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,没有炫酷的跑车 没有打折的好书\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the fancy cars,the book deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.03,0:06:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,没活儿干的日子可不轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Short of business can be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.79,0:06:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在生意挺好的 谢谢关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing fine,thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.96,0:06:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,真不巧 你这次现身在了恶魔陷阱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,good luck landing inside a devil's trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.22,0:06:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你们想知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.66,0:06:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowley在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.20,0:06:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一次有他的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time I heard,he was somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.87,0:06:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他正在太平洋西部乱搞\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the western pacific.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.89,0:06:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,还真有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.74,0:06:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,别搞笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.86,0:06:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他的领土都乱成一锅粥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fooling around in the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.22,0:07:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他还有心情看海\N{\fnArial\fs30}While his kingdom goes up in flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.24,0:07:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.20,0:07:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,地狱现在情况非常不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell's getting crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.54,0:07:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,就连昔日的死党们都想倒向Abaddon了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the loyalists wanna assigned on with Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.73,0:07:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,她动作不小\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gotta make her move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.70,0:07:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,完事儿了没 我还有点儿私事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we done, I got a thing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.34,0:07:18.44,Note,,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.44,0:07:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗 你要驱逐我 我们刚做了个交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?An exorcism?We had a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.26,0:07:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,回见了 Snooks\N{\fnArial\fs30}See ya,Snooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.73,0:07:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,小妇人 Meg Jo Beth和Amy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little Women.Meg,Jo,Beth and Amy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.83,0:07:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,作者Louisa M Alcott\N{\fnArial\fs30}Written by Louisa M Alcott.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.45,0:07:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,甜心 我回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.83,0:07:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你好呀 小南瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello,Pumkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.60,0:07:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,今天过得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you have a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.81,0:07:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola去购物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lola did some shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.40,0:07:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来Lola买的东西还不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like Lola did a lot of shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.70,0:07:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不全都是给我自己买的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not all of it is for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.25,0:07:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,看呐 看呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looky,looky.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.23,0:07:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,希望口感不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope it's a good vintage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.83,0:07:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来配着点儿酒一起喝会更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well you look like you could use a little pick-me-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.68,0:08:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢你喝醉之后的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just love what it does for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.66,0:08:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.18,0:08:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You try to play me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.97,0:08:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我才是老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I play the tune.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.49,0:08:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,其他人都必须按着我的规则来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone else dances to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.41,0:08:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 明白了吗 - 明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got it? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.10,0:08:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.42,0:08:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我的小老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my rodent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.89,0:08:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我那个跑到Abaddon跟前\N{\fnArial\fs30}My little rodent until when scarring off to Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.17,0:08:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,去告我状的小老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}To rat on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.89,0:08:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.54,0:08:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你真觉得其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think some other low life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.05,0:08:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不会出卖你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't sell you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.37,0:08:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来以为你是个聪明的好女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were a smart girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.46,0:08:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来能帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A girl I could've helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.95,0:08:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're joking right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.28,0:08:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.70,0:08:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.21,0:08:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你谁都帮不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't help anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.01,0:09:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,马里亚纳大海沟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Mariana Trench.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.70,0:10:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.75,0:10:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.00,0:10:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Cain说初刃被藏在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cain said that the first blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.22,0:10:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,海的最深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was tossed into the deepest ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.99,0:10:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定就是马里亚纳大海沟\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the Mariana Trench.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.07,0:10:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定Crowley早就找到初刃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Crowley found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.04,0:10:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,只不过在骗我们玩儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's a double cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.79,0:10:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,没有道理啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.45,0:10:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他想让我得到初刃 去杀了Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants me to power up and kill that ginger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.27,0:10:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是他的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}He set it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.70,0:10:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 假设他真的把初刃带过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK,assuming he does show up with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.13,0:10:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们拿到初刃之后 Crowley就没用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley is only useful to us until we have the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.97,0:10:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.88,0:10:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.00,0:10:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也可以反过来利用他\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing stopping us from using it on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.64,0:10:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.44,0:10:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,完全可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.15,0:10:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,说曹操曹操到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak to devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.84,0:10:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你找到初刃了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find the first blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.70,0:10:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,还不算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.04,0:10:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那你是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well then what exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.50,0:11:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在有点儿小麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in a jam I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.15,0:11:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你们应该能帮得上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you might help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.47,0:11:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好呀 孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello,boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.96,0:11:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你管这个叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what do you call this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.20,0:11:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,饭后甜点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Refreshments.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.50,0:11:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 袋子里装的是什么 Crowley - 没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's in the package Crowley - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.54,0:11:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗 那我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really,maybe I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.71,0:11:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么搞的 抢劫了血库吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you...knocking over blood banks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.93,0:11:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.46,0:11:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你自己 像什么样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you,you're a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.49,0:11:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我们都指着你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know we were counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.35,0:11:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你让我们失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.52,0:11:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你那帮地狱狗腿子也都指望着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your slimy followers were counting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.71,0:11:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉Abaddon呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}On you to kill Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.68,0:12:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你让他们失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.38,0:12:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,最厉害的恶魔 邪恶之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man with all the mojo.Captain Evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.04,0:12:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,真可悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.22,0:12:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.94,0:12:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,劝说大会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}An intervention.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.29,0:12:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要集中精力 Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to focus,Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.81,0:12:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,认真一点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.57,0:12:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你是打算让地狱见鬼去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you are just gonna let the hell go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.34,0:12:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本不知道做人的滋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what it's like to be human.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.12,0:12:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,汝之血\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.06,0:12:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,吾之瘾\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my addiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.25,0:12:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是我的负担\N{\fnArial\fs30}My cross.My burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.75,0:12:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,行 放松点\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.90,0:12:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在知道这种瘾有多恐怖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see the darkness of it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.63,0:12:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,比政治还恐怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Anthony Weiner of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.20,0:12:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那种永远填不满的欲望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes you needy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.80,0:12:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要Lola\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.73,0:12:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但她利用了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lola used me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.39,0:12:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,她把知道的都通报给Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}She reported everything I did back to Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.26,0:12:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.92,0:12:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,她知道初刃吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you tell her about the first blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.62,0:12:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.80,0:12:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嗑上药之后记不住事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things get a trifle blurry when I'm medicaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.12,0:13:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这下可好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.37,0:13:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola知道了一定会告诉Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he told Lola,she definitely told Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.89,0:13:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,所以Abaddon也在寻找初刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means that Abaddon's in the hunt of this thing,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.12,0:13:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉你 你现在这状态立刻换掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,you know what?This crap ends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.25,0:13:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,现在这样子立刻终止 明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're cut off.Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.74,0:13:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,戒掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kicking it.Cold turkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.98,0:13:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,又回到老地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back in this fetid pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.78,0:13:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,连枕头都不给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could at least have added some throw pillows.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.65,0:13:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,集中注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Focus.Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.46,0:13:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你搜过了马里亚纳海沟 然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You swept Mariana's trench,and.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.88,0:13:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,出乎意料的是 初刃不在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the first blade was not as hoped in the trench.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.85,0:13:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,很早以前就被一艘无人驾驶的潜水艇捞上来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That in fact had been scooped up by an unmanned sub.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.02,0:13:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,然后被一个研究助理偷走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}From whom it was stolen by research assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.31,0:13:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,之后又卖给了葡萄牙走私贩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who reportedlly sold it to Portuguese smugglar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.12,0:13:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他打牌的时候输给了摩洛哥海盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who in turn lost it to Moroccan pirates in a poker game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.80,0:13:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.84,0:13:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,可怜的鹿鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor moose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.28,0:13:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,跟上我的思路不太容易 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always a little tricky keeping up isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.39,0:14:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你看什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.40,0:14:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我被人性玷污了而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still a little tainted by humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.67,0:14:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,略伤感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes me sentimental.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.82,0:14:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.91,0:14:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你我都知道去年教堂里发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I both know we shared a mo back in that church.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.22,0:14:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,某种程度上说 我们是一体的\N{\fnArial\fs30}On some level,we are bonded.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.60,0:14:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowley 你知道你为什么还活着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley.The only reason you are alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.78,0:14:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,因为要你帮我们除掉Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that we need your help to deel with Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.70,0:14:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,比起她 你还不算彻底的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause she is the even worse pile of crap than you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.95,0:14:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我对你就这么点怜惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's the extent of my concerns for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.16,0:14:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.71,0:14:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,海盗之后发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.What happened after the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.68,0:14:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is Crowley doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.01,0:14:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,偷糖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stealing candies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.76,0:15:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他 呃 他 他在偷糖\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is..He He's stealing candies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.49,0:15:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,至少Cass变成人的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,at least when Cass was human.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.82,0:15:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是个正常人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was an okay guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.66,0:15:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,早该想到Crowley就是个混混\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should've known Crowley would be a douche version.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.91,0:15:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 说你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.29,0:15:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,别乱来了行吗 注意形象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut it out man.Image.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.69,0:15:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你是地狱之王 有个王的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the king of rotten,act like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.09,0:15:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得那家伙会来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think this guy's gonna show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.20,0:15:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我看不像会有人愿意在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean this isn't exactly a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.61,0:15:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,做几百万的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where a million dollar's deal go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.64,0:15:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 传言说 这个叫André Develin的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.Word is this André Develin character.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.35,0:15:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,从海盗手里买下初刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bought the blade from the pirates,and he's.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.84,0:15:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,到处拿着卖 我就知道这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been shopping it around.That's all I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.61,0:15:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,注意 来人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,heads up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.04,0:15:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Devilon先生 我们打过电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr.Devilon We spoke on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.27,0:15:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你之前说你代表一个正经的买家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you represent a serious collector.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.00,0:15:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,想通过私下交易的方式来交货\N{\fnArial\fs30}With an interest in a private transaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.08,0:15:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.94,0:15:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 是吗 其实他的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,well.What he meant to say was.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.65,0:16:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是FBI的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we are with the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.56,0:16:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你们晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.14,0:16:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 我们只想打探一下消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.We just want some answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.68,0:16:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Read Sartre\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read Sartre.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.32,0:16:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Jean-Paul Sartre\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jean-Paul Sartre.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.95,0:16:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是帮买家和卖家牵线而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm merely a fascilitator between the buyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.04,0:16:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,干中间人买卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the seller,a conduit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.66,0:16:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你们要拘留我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So unless I'm been detained.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.62,0:16:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,请问是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.97,0:16:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,请问我被拘留了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been detained.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.98,0:16:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,目前没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.03,0:16:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,没 但我们会时刻留意你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.But we've got our eyes on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.74,0:16:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,国家文物研究所\N{\fnArial\fs30}National Institute of Antiquties.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.66,0:17:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,炸弹 又赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gin.Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.68,0:17:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,给你们带了点吃的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brought you guys something for your shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.48,0:17:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.30,0:18:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我也没发现什么特别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have much for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.95,0:18:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这两个保安都是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guards are good men.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.32,0:18:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,在这儿工作好几年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd been here for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.48,0:18:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,按时上班 老实巴交\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vetted,honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.32,0:18:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 但是 - 但是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But - But.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.82,0:18:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,监视录像拍到 助理研究员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security camera shows a reaserch assistant caught them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.41,0:18:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,撞见他们打开1号保险库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breaking into vault number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.96,0:18:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,就是她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.16,0:18:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,更奇怪了不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gets weirder.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.06,0:19:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我之前说的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.29,0:19:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那个保险库里有什么特别的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything special about the paticular vault they opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.25,0:19:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,1号保险库是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vault number one is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.50,0:19:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,储存新到的文物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where they keep rare and new acquisitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.17,0:19:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,还在接受鉴定\N{\fnArial\fs30}While they are being examined.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.99,0:19:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,被偷的是哪一件\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what was stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.51,0:19:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,重点就在这 什么都没丢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a kicker Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.59,0:19:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,馆长McIlroy博士说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The curator Doctor McIlroy said.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.02,0:19:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这个保险库已经空了几个星期了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vault's been empty for weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.44,0:19:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,探员 打扰一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me,detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.72,0:19:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来理一下思路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,so just connect the dots here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.52,0:19:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他们刚来的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blade was likely put in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.57,0:19:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,初刃很可能被放在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they first got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.38,0:19:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,然后保安被附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guards are obviously demons,so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.10,0:19:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,然后 发现是空的 没有初刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}What,when the vault turned out to be empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.17,0:19:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,就杀了这两个皮囊 然后跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They killed their guard meat suits and smoked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.06,0:19:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,去向谁汇报\N{\fnArial\fs30}And reported back to who.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.38,0:19:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Abaddon吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.05,0:19:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,她就在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's closing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.58,0:19:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说初刃从来没有展出过\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the first blade was never on display.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.99,0:19:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,研究所没有认证过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No authenticated item by that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.00,0:19:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,初刃这种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was ever on this premises.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.61,0:19:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,认证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Authenticated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.51,0:19:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,McElroy博士 这把匕首被\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr.McElroy,this blade was stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.73,0:20:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,偷运进美国已经违反了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And smuggled into the US in violation of treaties.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.53,0:20:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,多国法律\N{\fnArial\fs30}With several governments.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.06,0:20:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以强迫你开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can compel you to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.22,0:20:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,强迫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Compel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.25,0:20:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,具体怎么强迫\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what might that involve.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.41,0:20:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.97,0:20:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我确实拿回来这个叫初刃的匕首\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did acquire this so called first blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.01,0:20:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,碳14测定确认该物属圣经时代\N{\fnArial\fs30}And carbon dating did peg it to biblical times.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.55,0:20:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但是权威认证却不这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the authentication proved unreliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.37,0:20:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,所以之前确实在保险库里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it was in the vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.58,0:20:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我把它拿出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I removed it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.43,0:20:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 保安不知道 - 现在在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The guards didn't know - Where is it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.45,0:20:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,几周前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Several weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.57,0:20:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,一个神秘买家出价要买\N{\fnArial\fs30}A confidential offer was made to purchase it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.46,0:20:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我害怕永远过不了权威认证那关 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was afraid we would never authenticate the thing,so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.75,0:20:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,买家是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was the buyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.02,0:20:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.02,0:20:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,买家要求信息绝对保密\N{\fnArial\fs30}The buyer insisted on absolute secrecy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.14,0:20:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 联邦法律刚好挡住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,federal statutes trump your little deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.15,0:20:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,买家信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,the buyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.42,0:20:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎么样 你是都要知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you'll get it out of me one way or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.03,0:20:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,对不对 探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't you, Agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.87,0:21:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我从来不知道他的真实身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never did know his real identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.02,0:21:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他自称Magnus\N{\fnArial\fs30}He called himself Magnus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.10,0:21:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,别问我他住在哪里 我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ask me where he lives I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.13,0:21:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我还有个会\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do have a meeting,so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.24,0:21:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的号码 如果你们还需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here is my number,should you need anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.88,0:21:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.58,0:21:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你听到她说的了吗 Magnus\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you catch that Magnus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.30,0:21:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Albert Magnus\N{\fnArial\fs30}Albert Magnus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.91,0:21:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,学者们想要销声匿迹的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name the Men of Letters used.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.38,0:21:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,用的化名\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they want to be incognito.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.25,0:21:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 但是所有的学者都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,but we know that all of the Men of Letters are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.37,0:21:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.48,0:21:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,夜床服务吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turndown service.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.33,0:21:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,请在我枕头上放块薄荷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like a mint on my pillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.73,0:21:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,关于1958年的学者大屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.67,0:22:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你都知道些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Men of Letters massacre of 1958.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.30,0:22:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道Larry Ganem\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know Abaddon missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.51,0:22:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,和我们的祖父从Abaddon手下逃生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our grandfather and Larry Ganem.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.07,0:22:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,还有别人活下来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was there anybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.07,0:22:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我就有话直说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.51,0:22:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你把我关在这个柜子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep me locked up in this closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.77,0:22:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,对我的痛苦不闻不问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ignore my suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.07,0:22:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,然后来这里讨价还价 要求我帮助你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then come barging in here and demand my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.09,0:22:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}More or less,yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.50,0:22:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,上一次我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I or did I not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.89,0:22:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,所有忙都帮完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep my end of the bargain the other night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.35,0:22:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,帮得还非常漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite brilliantly,I might add.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.85,0:22:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可是搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.06,0:22:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你们欠我个人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you owe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.38,0:22:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还欠你 - 如果不是为了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Owe you - I wouldn't be in this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.20,0:22:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不会身陷麻烦之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it wasn't for you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.05,0:22:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你们抓了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shoot me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.85,0:22:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,把我变成了瘾君子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make me a junkie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.14,0:22:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你们一藏把我藏好几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep me stashed away for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.70,0:22:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,同时间里我的王国都快崩塌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}While my kingdom falls apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.43,0:22:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.79,0:22:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这苏格兰威士忌可不怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a very good scotch,is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.71,0:22:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowley 我们已经翻遍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,Crowley,we have gone through the records.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.22,0:22:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,1958年全部的人员名单\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the entire membership in 1958.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.51,0:22:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,每个名字都能和死人中的一个对上号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every single name matches the men who were killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.54,0:23:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 那只是一线活跃人员名单 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be the active membership,correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.17,0:23:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩个是不是脑子出问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you two dropped on your heads a great deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.24,0:23:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉过你们的 有消息说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I told you,rumor has it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.77,0:23:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,有个笨蛋因为他的愚蠢行为被开除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That a rogue member was tossed out on his arse.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.71,0:23:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这还能活跃在一线吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That make him active.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.37,0:23:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,说真的 孩子们 离了我你们怎么活啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously,boys,how did you ever function without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.09,0:23:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你好啊 Ichigatsu小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,hello,Miss Ichigatsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.36,0:23:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Infamati et obliterati\N{\fnArial\fs30}Infamati et obliterati.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.05,0:23:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,羞耻即被遗忘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dishonored and forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.70,0:23:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.08,0:23:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙真与众不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy was something.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.53,0:23:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好拗口的名字 - 嗯 Cuthbert Sinclair\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tough name - Yeah,Cuthbert Sinclair.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.16,0:23:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是喜欢Magnus\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have just gone with Magnus.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.42,0:23:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来是他设计了大部分的防御系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like he designed most of the warding.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.48,0:23:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,来保护地堡的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}That keeps the bunker safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.15,0:24:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这里说他被称为咒语大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says here that he was named Master of Spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.86,0:24:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,就在他发起这个之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right after he initiated it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.52,0:24:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,似乎他的研究后来发展得有点疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess his work got a little crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.00,0:24:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他被形容为怪异的和不负责任的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The leadership called it eccentric and irresponsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.95,0:24:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 这些是他在这儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good,so these are the projects that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.62,0:24:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,最后几年里 提出的课题\N{\fnArial\fs30}He proposed in the last of years he was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.13,0:24:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.26,0:24:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,否决 否决 否决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rejected,rejected,rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.65,0:24:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,太困难了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.96,0:24:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,一代英才 生不逢时 被其蔑视\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brilliant,ahead of your time,dispised for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.74,0:24:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 我深有体会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.70,0:24:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,正式脱离学者组织是在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Formal separation from Man of Letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.08,0:24:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,1956年4月\N{\fnArial\fs30}April 1956.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.11,0:24:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,刚好错过了那场屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}He missed the massacre.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.10,0:24:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直不知道他叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never knew his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.85,0:24:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我知道有人避过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I heard someone was out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.47,0:24:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,费了好大劲也没找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did my damnest to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.15,0:24:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得他也许是我了解这个契合点的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought he might be my way inside this joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.50,0:24:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 你找到了哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where did you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.58,0:24:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你的手下们跟踪到他的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is where your demons tracked him to.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.04,0:24:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exact spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.75,0:25:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我的手下一直找不到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}My boys could never find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.23,0:25:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么都没感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sensing nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.87,0:25:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他在这里的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if he's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.14,0:25:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是被这些沟壑防御起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's warded up to the gills.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.19,0:25:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他是这方面的天才 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,he's a genius at it,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.86,0:25:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定知道怎样不被恶魔找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure as hell ain't gonna be found by a bunch of demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.89,0:25:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,说得像他会向你们吐露心声一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like he's gonna open his heart to you lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.06,0:25:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你们是宝藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you are such prizes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.37,0:25:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,比这还要好 我们是传人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better,we are legacies.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.82,0:25:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他藏在这里的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,if he's so bent on hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.85,0:25:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,可能他看得到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.68,0:25:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,试试吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.86,0:25:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cuthbert Sinclair还是Magnus 随便你叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cuthbert Sinclair,Magnus,whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.89,0:25:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是Sam和Dean Winchester\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are Sam and Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.62,0:25:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Henry Winchester的孙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry Winchester's grandsons.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.61,0:25:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也是学者\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Man of Letters ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.23,0:25:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道之前发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know what happened back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.99,0:25:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们并不赞成你的做法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't necessarily agree with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.86,0:25:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们想\N{\fnArial\fs30}We figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.07,0:26:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你想给我们讲讲你眼中的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you want to tell your side of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.65,0:26:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,往哪边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.22,0:27:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,真棒 干得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravo.Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.42,0:27:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,真抱歉 刚才来那么一出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about all these theatricality.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.40,0:27:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想看看你们到底是什么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to see what you two were made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.06,0:27:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是在地下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,what,are we underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.42,0:27:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你们站的地方就是我堡垒的所在地\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,my fortress was where you were standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.18,0:27:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 它是隐形的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But,it's invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.39,0:27:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定就是Curthbert Sinclair\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you must be Cuthbert Sinclair.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.36,0:27:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我没用那个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't done by that moniker in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.60,0:27:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,已经57年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}57 years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.10,0:27:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,对于一个快90岁的人来说 你看起来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are looking good for a guy pushing 90.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.84,0:27:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,thanks,sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.32,0:27:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,几乎没有什么事是咒语办不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a spell for damn near everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.02,0:27:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你们让我印象深刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm impressed though.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.93,0:27:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你们正好做到了你们该做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did exactly what you should have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.61,0:27:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然 我还是会想念我怪兽动物园中的那两只\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though I'm gonna miss those two from my zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.98,0:27:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你的怪兽动物园\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.62,0:27:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.39,0:27:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你们正身处\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are in the mist of.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.78,0:27:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,世界上最伟大的超自然\N{\fnArial\fs30}The greatest collection of supernatural rarities.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.82,0:27:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,收藏馆中\N{\fnArial\fs30}And antiquities on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.26,0:28:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 你们是不是说你们是学者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.Did you say that you are the man of letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.46,0:28:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为1958之后就没那个组织了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that whole thing's dead after '58.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.37,0:28:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们 我们是传人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are,we are legacies.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.63,0:28:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 事实上 我们是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But,actually,we are hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.26,0:28:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.85,0:28:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,猎人 手握着王国的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunters,with the key to the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.68,0:28:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那些死学者们肯定在坟墓里高兴地起舞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys must be spinning in their graves.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.21,0:28:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,势利小人们 要我说 他们就是一群图书管理员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn snobs,bunch of librarians if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.27,0:28:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 我一直很喜欢Henry\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although,I was always found of Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.07,0:28:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我是他的导师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was his mentor,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.75,0:28:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,直到那群老家伙给我穿小鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,till the squares gave me the boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.35,0:28:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 他也来拜访过我 秘密地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course,he came here to visit me,in secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.75,0:28:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,也是像你们这样呼喊我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Called out to me the same way you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.15,0:28:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 对 离你们的祖父来这里已经有一些时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,yes,quite a while here your grandfather was.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.00,0:28:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 Magnus 我们现在有一个状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen,Magnus,we got ourselves a situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.09,0:28:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Abaddon 最后一个地狱骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abaddon,the last knight of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.99,0:28:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,正在试图夺权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is looking to up her pay grade and take over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.17,0:28:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,事情真是一成不变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things never change,do they.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.50,0:29:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前一遍遍地告诉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kept telling the boys over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.35,0:29:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我说 我们可以阻止这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would say,we could stop all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.60,0:29:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以一次性消灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could rid of the monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.93,0:29:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,世界上所有的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the world once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.87,0:29:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们能用心的话 但是他们说不\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we just put our minds to it,but oh no,they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.39,0:29:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是我们的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,no,no,it's not our place.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.45,0:29:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是来做研究的 做分类整理工作的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here to study.We are here to catalogue.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.51,0:29:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们明白 他们是书呆子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,we get it.They were geeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.39,0:29:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我们可以阻止她\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she can be stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.35,0:29:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你有我们需要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we need something we hear you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.66,0:29:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,初刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.32,0:29:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.82,0:29:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.37,0:29:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,但是如果你们真的做足了功课的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you'd really done your homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.99,0:29:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你们就知道初刃根本没有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would know that it's absolutely useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.57,0:29:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你们有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless of course you are possessing the.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.14,0:29:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一个印记 - 该隐之印\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mark - The mark of Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.86,0:29:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.60,0:29:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么弄到这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you come by that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.95,0:29:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 如果Abaddon掌权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen,If Abaddon takes over.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.15,0:29:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,她最想做的一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one thing she wants more than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.52,0:29:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,就是将人间变为地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is to make hell on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.44,0:29:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,就算是你也逃不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even you can escape that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.22,0:30:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,人们都说猎人都是蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they say all hunters are morons.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.12,0:30:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,就在你们身后 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's right there behind you,gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.72,0:30:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你刚说的采取行动的话是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen,if you are serious about taking actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.25,0:30:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我们在采取行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}This...This is taking action.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.98,0:30:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你借我们初刃 我们去阻止那个贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You loan us that blade and we will stop the bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.57,0:30:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我来考虑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.20,0:30:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我想好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,I thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.94,0:30:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Magnus和Dean在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magnus has Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.78,0:30:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你对我弟弟做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do with my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.93,0:30:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 他没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.He's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.24,0:30:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我做了所有伟大的收藏家都会做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I did what any good collector would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.40,0:30:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,把平凡的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I separate the ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.63,0:30:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,和非凡的分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.93,0:30:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我有初刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had the first blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.80,0:31:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 我也有了该隐之印来完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now,I have the Mark of Cain to complete the set.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.88,0:31:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是 该隐之印和我是一体的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,the problem is it's attached.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.16,0:31:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你把初刃给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how about you loan me the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.48,0:31:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我来完成这些怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I take care of the business.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.40,0:31:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean 我给你的是再好不过选择了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean,I'm offering you the moon here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.58,0:31:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,可以成为史上最伟大的收藏的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be part of the greatest collection of all time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.14,0:31:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,永葆青春\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be young forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.50,0:31:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我来告诉你我的秘密吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me teach you my secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.26,0:31:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,来陪我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be my companion.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.96,0:31:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,老实说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to be honest with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.75,0:31:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这些年来 我有些寂寞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has gotten lonely here over the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.88,0:31:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你说这话的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you were saying any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.82,0:31:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有觉得有些诡异\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did it feel at all creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.24,0:31:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 我就拿着刀直接离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now,I'm just gonna grab the blade and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.46,0:31:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这个地方有个设计缺陷\N{\fnArial\fs30}One little design flaw of the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.53,0:31:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,没有窗户 没有门\N{\fnArial\fs30}No windows,no doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.63,0:31:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,in that case.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.10,0:31:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我只好自己动手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just make my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.26,0:31:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,挺不错的小咒语吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tricky little spell that first one,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.77,0:31:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,中国来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chinese.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.51,0:31:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,小魔术师的手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheap magician's trick on that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.43,0:31:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,摸兜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Picked your pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.90,0:31:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,枪不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.93,0:32:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎成为收藏品的一员 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the collection,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.35,0:32:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,想试试吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.68,0:32:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,谁能想到呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would have think it,moose.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.25,0:32:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你和我 同一战线 同一战壕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me,same team,in the trenches.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.42,0:32:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,完事之后 我们可以弄个情侣纹身\N{\fnArial\fs30}When this is over we can get matching tattoos.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.52,0:32:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我要澄清一点 Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,just to be clear,Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.07,0:32:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们什么都站不到一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not on the same,anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.71,0:32:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便说一句 既然这个地方已经被咒语保护了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way,since the place is warded.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.02,0:32:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你的功力也发挥不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your powers are useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.76,0:32:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说 你比平常更没用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means you are useless,even more so than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.77,0:32:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你进去的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are gonna need another set of hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.99,0:32:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定需要帮手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you get in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.38,0:32:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你已经有了其他的志愿者人选\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you have the volunteers in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.38,0:32:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks,pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.30,0:32:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我没记错的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Memory serves me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.50,0:32:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是我帮你哥找到了Cain\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the one who helped your brother find Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.40,0:32:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们才找到了初刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that we can find the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.31,0:32:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,再之后Dean才收到了印记\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that Dean could receive the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.93,0:33:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是我把Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one who flashed out loud that Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.30,0:33:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,从你身上扯出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of your nogging.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.25,0:33:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,lately,big boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.15,0:33:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,最近我的贡献比你多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'e served more playing time than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.91,0:33:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Crwoley 你能不能闭上该死的嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley,will you please shut the hell up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.66,0:33:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你还真是一个小可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh you're a really sorry piece of work you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.05,0:33:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,窝在这里 什么都不做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holed up in here,doing nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.98,0:33:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你还说学者的不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bitching about men of letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.43,0:33:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你可差远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're way worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.76,0:33:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,来试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we fire it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.95,0:33:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.25,0:33:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.79,0:33:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,come on,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.87,0:33:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这不就是你要找的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the object of your quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.65,0:33:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我 Henry Winchester的孙儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me,Henry Winchester's grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.87,0:33:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不想知道这东西管不管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't curious to see if it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.05,0:33:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,把手给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.39,0:33:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,手 给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.46,0:33:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.84,0:34:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.97,0:34:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,下次会更顺畅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time it'll be easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.28,0:34:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你会习惯的 甚至会喜欢这感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll get used to the feelings,even welcome them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.81,0:34:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's something.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.10,0:34:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,显然 他想将整个学者基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently,he wanted to make the entire.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.75,0:34:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,变成隐形的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men of letters' bunker invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.62,0:34:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,所有物理实物的入口都会被封锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}All physical points of entry were to be eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.58,0:34:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,唯一的进入方法是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And entrance would only be gained.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.59,0:34:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}By spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.81,0:34:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,看来我们需要点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need some things.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.68,0:34:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你可能真的能派上用场了 Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}You actually might turn out to be useful,Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.81,0:34:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你会明白的Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll come to understand,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.67,0:34:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,没有什么可以阻挡我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing can stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.84,0:34:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,任何东西 任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything,anyone we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.02,0:34:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我们想要或者摧毁的 都逃不掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Own or destroy is ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.19,0:34:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那这样如何 Magnus\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,how about this,Magnus.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.02,0:35:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,假如我不肯这么干呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about I take a knee.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.96,0:35:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那你会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what are you gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.97,0:35:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?You gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.38,0:35:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,因为假如没有我胳膊上的印记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause without this thing on my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.34,0:35:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那把刀就只是块带牙齿的骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Blade's nothing but a hunk of bone with teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.29,0:35:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我并不是在征求你的同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,I'm not asking you for your cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.94,0:35:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我会直接来拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just taking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.63,0:35:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉很有趣吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.38,0:35:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的思想和意愿都\N{\fnArial\fs30}All thought,all will just.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.07,0:35:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,从你身体里被吸干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drained out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.80,0:35:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我干这个早就干够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do this enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.34,0:35:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,现在无论我想要你做什么 你都会立刻准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be ready for whatever I have in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.26,0:35:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我做的不错吧 麋鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did good,moose.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.43,0:35:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,单子上的东西都齐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything on the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.08,0:35:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不用谢啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.71,0:35:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,记住 跟紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember,stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.77,0:36:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,按我说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.48,0:36:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都不许说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut the hell up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.81,0:36:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,抱着就行了 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm growing on you,aren't I.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.48,0:36:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,真喜欢他重新装修的风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love what he has done to this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.86,0:37:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,带我去找我哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me to my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.61,0:37:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam,no.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.50,0:37:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,变形怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shapeshifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.45,0:37:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了吧 这就是开怪兽动物园的好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see?There are benefit to keeping a zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.26,0:37:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.53,0:37:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我对你太早下定论了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I discarded you far too quickly,Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.67,0:37:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你比我想象的还要有价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are way more valuable than I thought you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.85,0:37:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么要装着被你制服了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I knock myself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.58,0:37:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,来降低你的警惕性呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to sap your will.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.92,0:37:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我手里有了Sam 就能让你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Sam here can get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.28,0:37:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,更好的理解我是怎么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}To see things in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.44,0:37:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Magnus我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magnus I swear to God.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.91,0:37:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么 你能怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?What're you gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.93,0:37:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他能怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is he gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.33,0:38:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 Sam 我不会杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,look,Sam,I'm not gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.80,0:38:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么要杀你呢 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not.But.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.82,0:38:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我会让你尝到无法想象的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna make you suffer unimaginably.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.77,0:38:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.71,0:38:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.86,0:38:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.54,0:38:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.78,0:38:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,把刃放下 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop the blade,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.25,0:38:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.07,0:38:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,把刃放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.62,0:39:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须说 真是太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brilliant,I must say.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.68,0:39:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,当然是说我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking of myself of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.19,0:39:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩永远是被绑起来挨揍的料\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you two manage to do is to get trussed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.24,0:39:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,有了我的大无畏行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Combining a little derring-do on my part.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.00,0:39:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,加上松鼠的蛮力\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little dumb muscle from squirrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.75,0:39:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,和麋鹿的几滴血\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little bleeding from moose.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.17,0:39:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,欢乐大结局 放片尾职员表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy ending,roll credits.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.02,0:39:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我去 搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,no,no!Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.46,0:39:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.24,0:39:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,硫磺 恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sulfur,demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.60,0:39:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Abaddon的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abaddon's.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.27,0:39:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,她比我们慢了一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just one jump behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.40,0:39:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,估计也是找不着Magnus\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess she couldn't find Magnus' joint either.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.95,0:39:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,后备箱怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.92,0:39:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,后备箱没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.93,0:39:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,保护咒没让他们得逞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warding kept them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.76,0:39:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,恶魔混蛋竟然动我宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demon mitts all over my baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.49,0:39:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.38,0:39:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,还敢刮花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now they're keying cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.21,0:40:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么语\N{\fnArial\fs30}What language is that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.82,0:40:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,天使语\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Enochian.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.91,0:40:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不是留给你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The message isn't for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.53,0:40:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.30,0:40:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,吓到尿裤子吧 女王陛下留\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be afraid,Your queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.20,0:40:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Abaddon是越来越厚脸皮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abaddon's getting more brazen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.21,0:40:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,她觉得我不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She thinks I'm losing my grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.16,0:40:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.44,0:40:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.08,0:40:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.15,0:40:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你说过 找到初刃之后Crowley就没用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said Crowley was only useful till we got the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.06,0:40:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,现在初刃找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.02,0:40:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,话说 孩儿们啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.49,0:40:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我欠你们一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in debt to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.75,0:40:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是你们帮我戒了人血\N{\fnArial\fs30}You forced sobriety on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.49,0:40:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我总算看清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I can see the situation for what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.42,0:40:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean 你还真是个厉害的杀戮机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean,you are quite the killing machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.13,0:40:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我突然想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it occurs to me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.77,0:40:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Abaddon不是唯一在你死亡名单上的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abaddon is not the only name on your list.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.19,0:40:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我自己恐怕也是榜上有名\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name,must be up there as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.12,0:41:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,没有我 你拿着它也没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no good to you without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.09,0:41:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,说的是 但是只要我拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,but as long as I have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.75,0:41:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,对你也没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no good to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.75,0:41:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 事情是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now this is the way it's going to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.33,0:41:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这老古董我拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll hang on to old donkey teeth here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.07,0:41:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,直到你能找到Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until such time as you locate Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.51,0:41:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你就能灭了她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you'll destroy her.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.84,0:41:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,麋鹿你之前说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right moose.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.51,0:41:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不能信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.63,0:41:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,遗憾的是 我也不能信任你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sadly, I can't trust you either
